"When Live Radar catches a question or a problem, your Think model looks for the answer in your work: first what LokalBot remembers (your projects and where they stand, your open actions, what you told it about yourself), then your meetings, what you saw on screen, and the folders below. It is given the question, the last few lines, what LokalBot remembers that bears on it, and the parts of meetings, screen text, documents, and code it reads. An answer is shown only when its sources contain the words it quotes." = "Saat Radar Langsung menangkap pertanyaan atau masalah, model Pikirkan Anda mencari jawabannya di pekerjaan Anda: pertama yang diingat LokalBot (proyek Anda dan perkembangannya, tindakan yang masih terbuka, hal yang Anda ceritakan tentang diri sendiri), lalu rapat Anda, apa yang Anda lihat di layar, dan folder di bawah. Model ini menerima pertanyaannya, beberapa baris terakhir, ingatan LokalBot yang relevan, serta bagian rapat, teks layar, dokumen, dan kode yang dibaca. Jawaban hanya ditampilkan jika sumbernya memuat kata-kata yang dikutipnya.";
"Documents, sheets, and PDFs in these folders can be read. In a git repository it also reads tracked code, recent commits, and pull requests and issues through the GitHub CLI. Hidden files, untracked files, and secrets such as .env files and keys are never read." = "Dokumen, spreadsheet, dan PDF di folder ini dapat dibaca. Di repositori git, LokalBot juga membaca kode yang dilacak, commit terbaru, serta pull request dan issue lewat GitHub CLI. File tersembunyi, file yang tidak dilacak, dan rahasia seperti file .env serta kunci tidak pernah dibaca.";
