"Read-only. LokalBot downloads conversations you wrote in and mail with people on your calendar from the last 90 days. Newsletters, promotions, and notifications are skipped. Mail stays encrypted on this Mac." = "Hanya baca. LokalBot mengunduh percakapan 90 hari terakhir tempat Anda ikut menulis, serta email dengan orang-orang di kalender Anda. Buletin, promosi, dan notifikasi dilewati. Email tetap terenkripsi di Mac ini.";
