"File search" = "Pencarian file";
"Search the folders you choose by what is in them: documents and PDFs by their words and meaning, pictures and screenshots by what they show. Files are read on this Mac and never changed." = "Cari di folder yang Anda pilih berdasarkan isinya: dokumen dan PDF berdasarkan kata dan maknanya, gambar dan tangkapan layar berdasarkan apa yang ditampilkannya. File dibaca di Mac ini dan tidak pernah diubah.";
"LokalBot reads only the folders listed here: pictures and screenshots, PDFs page by page, and documents such as txt, md, rtf, docx, odt and html. It skips hidden folders, app bundles, caches, code projects (except their screenshots), folders that look like datasets, and iCloud files that are not downloaded. With recordings and video included, sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot, so a search can open the moment in LokalBot's player. The index keeps each file's path, its text, and a vector of what it says, shows or sounds like, in the LokalBot library. The image and text model downloads once and runs only while new or changed files are read. Reading pauses while a meeting records, in Low Power Mode, and while the Mac is warm. While you use the Mac, a folder's first read goes at about a third of full speed, and at full speed once you step away. On battery it waits for a charger unless Read big folders on battery is on." = "LokalBot hanya membaca folder yang tercantum di sini: gambar dan tangkapan layar, PDF per halaman, serta dokumen seperti txt, md, rtf, docx, odt, dan html. LokalBot melewati folder tersembunyi, bundel app, cache, proyek kode (kecuali tangkapan layarnya), folder yang tampak seperti dataset, dan file iCloud yang belum diunduh. Jika rekaman dan video disertakan, suara dibaca per 30 detik dan video satu bingkai per adegan, sehingga pencarian dapat membuka momen tersebut di pemutar LokalBot. Indeks menyimpan jalur setiap file, teksnya, dan vektor dari apa yang dikatakan, ditampilkan, atau diperdengarkannya, di pustaka LokalBot. Model gambar dan teks diunduh sekali dan hanya berjalan saat file baru atau yang berubah sedang dibaca. Pembacaan dijeda saat rapat sedang direkam, dalam Mode Daya Rendah, dan saat Mac sedang hangat. Saat Anda memakai Mac, pembacaan pertama folder berjalan dengan sekitar sepertiga kecepatan penuh, dan dengan kecepatan penuh begitu Anda beranjak. Saat memakai baterai, pembacaan itu menunggu pengisi daya kecuali “Baca folder besar saat memakai baterai” aktif.";
"Search by meaning also matches what captured screens show. The first such search downloads EmbeddingGemma 2's image model (555 MB); picture vectors are deleted with the pixels." = "Pencarian berdasarkan makna juga mencocokkan apa yang ditampilkan layar yang ditangkap. Pencarian pertama semacam itu mengunduh model gambar EmbeddingGemma 2 (555 MB); vektor gambar dihapus bersama pikselnya.";
"Include recordings and video" = "Sertakan rekaman dan video";
"Sound is read 30 seconds at a time and video a frame per shot. A first pass over hours of video takes a while." = "Suara dibaca per 30 detik dan video satu bingkai per adegan. Proses pertama untuk video berjam-jam memerlukan waktu cukup lama.";
"Read big folders on battery" = "Baca folder besar saat memakai baterai";
